---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Stop Paying Owler Pricing | OllaSuper"
  description="Skip expensive Owler pricing. Deploy OllaSuper's AI agents to actively research and engage prospects automatically. Save budget and scale faster today."
  current="solutions"
>
  <article class="os-section" style="background: var(--bg-soft); padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
    <div class="os-container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      
      <div class="os-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-12);">
        <span class="os-live-dot"></span> COMPETITIVE COMPARISON
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="os-h1" style="margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 3rem;">Owler Pricing Alternatives: Why OllaSuper is the Better Choice</h1>
      
      <p class="os-lead" style="margin-bottom: 48px; line-height: 1.8;">
        Are you tired of paying rigid data subscriptions that just hand you static information? The modern sales team doesn't just need data; they need action. Explore why swapping expensive <strong>Owler pricing</strong> contracts for an autonomous digital workforce is the fastest path to scaling your revenue operations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Understanding Owler Pricing in 2026</h2>
      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">What You Actually Get (and What's Missing)</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        Owler provides competitive intelligence and company data. You pay a premium for access to this static database. But having the data is only 10% of the battle; your human SDRs still have to log in, read it, interpret it, and figure out how to use it in an email.
      </p>

      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">The Hidden Costs of Manual Research Tools</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        When you pay for static data platforms, you are still paying for the human labor required to utilize them. If your reps are spending 2 hours a day doing account research on Owler before sending emails, the true cost of the tool includes thousands of dollars in lost selling time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px;">OllaSuper vs. Owler: A Structural Difference</h2>
      
      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">Static Company Data vs. Autonomous Research Agents</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        Owler requires a human driver. OllaSuper does not. OllaSuper's autonomous agents can browse the live web, access real-time news, and pull company data natively, and then instantly apply that research to qualify a lead.
      </p>

      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">How OllaSuper Acts on Data (Instead of Just Reporting It)</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        Once an OllaSuper agent finds a relevant triggering event—like a leadership change or funding round—it doesn't just alert you. It automatically drafts a hyper-personalized email referencing the event, updates your CRM, and queues the message for your approval. 
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Why Sales Teams Are Switching from Owler to OllaSuper</h2>
      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 24px;">True ROI: Replacing Subscriptions with a Digital Workforce</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        Cancel your expensive data subscriptions. By deploying an OllaSuper AI employee, you gain the research capabilities of tools like Owler combined with the execution capabilities of a top-tier SDR. The ROI is immediate: lower software costs, zero manual research time, and significantly higher outbound volume.
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 24px;">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
          <h4 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-primary);">Does OllaSuper provide company data like Owler?</h4>
          <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">Yes. OllaSuper agents utilize real-time web browsing and integrated data enrichment APIs to gather the same—if not more current—company intelligence as static databases.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
          <h4 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-primary);">Is OllaSuper more cost-effective?</h4>
          <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">Absolutely. Because you are consolidating a data platform and the labor required to use it into a single autonomous agent, the total cost of ownership is drastically lower.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 48px;">
        <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Stop paying for static data. Hire an agent that acts on it.</h2>
        <a href="https://app.ollasuper.com/login" class="os-btn os-btn-primary" style="padding: 12px 32px;">Start with OllaSuper Today →</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
